iractal planked.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$0.90/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$116.69/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$145.86/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The Suiratcal is a tree found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Void\" title=\"The Void\">The Void Grove</a> Biome, in the Island in the middle of the place. To get to the tree, you have to drive or walk across narrow bridge-like rocks.\n</p><p>It is recommended but not required to bring a <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Etcher\" title=\"Shadow Etcher\">Shadow Etcher</a> as it deals 2x damage to the Suiratcal.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Staff\" title=\"Lunar Staff\">Lunar Staff</a>, or the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a> is recommended as the tree is typically on the edge and will fall into the void when cut down.\n</p><p>it was, nerfed from $207.70/stud planked to near $135.7/stud planked. This is slightly less than the <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Tree\" title=\"Snow Tree\">Snow Tree</a>, which is far easier to obtain, however Suiratcal is still much better if you manage to get enough, due to its sheer width.\n</p><p>It takes roughly 5-8 minutes for the Suiratcal to respawn however if you leave the stump from a previous tree there it will never respawn until the stumps gone.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fun_facts:\">Fun facts:</span></h3>\n<p>1. The <a href=\"/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter_Upgrade\" title=\"Freyliner Transporter Upgrade\">box</a> variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter\" title=\"Freyliner Transporter\">Freyliner Transporter</a> can in fact traverse the bridges to the Suiratcal tree, and fit under the arches, allowing you to get around 2.5 trees, or just 1 if its mutated to be large. \n</p><p>2. if you want to grind and not fail try magma caves as if you cut and sand 1 tree it is very simple to move and you can have a better time grinding  \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901195455\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019445/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.145      1 Template:Wood\n100.00%   38.145      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4353-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901195455 and revision id 21656. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tree"],"links":[{"title":"Freyliner Transporter","exists":true},{"title":"Freyliner Transporter Upgrade","exists":true},{"title":"Grabbiest Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Lunar Staff","exists":true},{"title":"Shadow Etcher","exists":true},{"title":"Snow Tree","exists":true},{"title":"The Void","exists":true}],"images":["Suiratcal_Tree.png","Suiractal_log.png","Suiractal_sanded.png","Suiractal_planked.png"]}
